      "role": "user",
      "content": "It cut off at the end there. You were saying it's like trying...? Also, can you go deeper into the \"friction\" part? You mentioned the stop-and-go cycle, but what actually causes the most disruption to the flow in these high-volume scenarios?",
      "source": "evaluator"
